  "name": "Example: Addition and Scalar Multiplication of Vectors in Component Form",
  "problem": "Find $\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}$ if $\\mathbf{a}=-4\\mathbf{i}+6\\mathbf{j}$ and $\\mathbf{b}=12\\mathbf{i}.$",
  "worked_solution": "To compute $\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b},$ we just need to compute all of the $\\mathbf{i}$'s and $\\mathbf{j}$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a-2b & =(-4i+6j)-2(12i) \\\\  & =-4i+6j-24i \\\\  & =(-4i-24i)+6j \\\\  & =-28i+6j\\end{aligned}\n$$",
